flowchart LR
  accTitle: Hot-replace is a shell compiler we do not have
  accDescr: A bash install line enters a meat grinder labeled hot-replace and comes out as broken PowerShell with flying quotes.
  linux["Linux playbook\napt install gh\nif [ -f /etc/os-release ]\nsudo systemctl ...\n\nLooks fine. On Linux."]
  grinder["HOT-REPLACE\napt to winget\nHOME to USERPROFILE\nand-and to semicolon\n\nThis is a compiler.\nWe do not have one."]
  windows["Translated Windows\nwinget install gh\nif [ -f C:/etc/os-release ]\nquoting? elevation? PATH?\n\nSame words. Wrong planet."]
  linux --> grinder --> windows
